# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
# React Router owns /candidates, /candidate/:slug, /leaderboard etc. on the client.
# Without this, a direct load or refresh of any route other than / returns 404,
# because Pages looks for a matching file on disk and finds none.
#
# /api/* is deliberately NOT rewritten — those requests must reach the Worker.
/api/*  /api/:splat  200
/*      /index.html  200
